      "message": "feat(post): clear G92 offsets and state G97 in LinuxCNC post\n\nThe LinuxCNC post header clears G92 offsets and states G97 constant RPM mode.\n\n- Write G92.1 in onOpen() to clear active G92 offsets from earlier work.\n- Add clearG92 post option (default true) to permit keeping G92 offsets.\n- State G97 in the modal safety block before the first spindle start.\n- Add G92.1 explanation text to explainWords.\n- Add pinning tests in crates/post/tests/linuxcnc_post.rs.\n\nFixes #4151",
